Description: Add-ons for Window Maker: notifications, file browser, media keys, menus
 Notification daemon, file browser and menu tools for Window Maker, themed
 from your Window Maker theme. Only one notification daemon can own
 org.freedesktop.Notifications, so stop dunst/mako first.
 .
 wmmediakeys handles the volume, media, brightness and launcher keys with an
 on-screen display in the same theme.
 .
 Run wm-autostart install to start wmmenud, wmnotify and wmmediakeys with
 Window Maker.
